### ============================================================
### CRM E2E sales pipeline — happy path
### ============================================================
### Response shape (all CRM APIs):
###   { "success": true, "message": "...", "data": { ... }, "timestamp": "..." }
### IDs live under data.id (or data.content[].id for paged lists).
### Flow + expected statuses:
###   1. Login                         → JWT
###   2. Create lead                   → LeadStatus = NEW
###   3. Qualify lead                  → LeadStatus = QUALIFIED
###   4. Convert lead                  → LeadStatus = CONVERTED
###                                    → Customer created
###                                    → Opportunity stage = NEW
###   5. Create quotation              → QuotationStatus = DRAFT
###   6. Send quotation (optional)     → QuotationStatus = SENT
###   7. Accept quotation              → QuotationStatus = ACCEPTED
###                                    → SalesOrder status = DRAFT (linked)
###   8. Confirm sales order           → OrderStatus = APPROVED
###                                    → publishes sales.order.confirmed (SKU/qty)
###   9. Create invoice                → InvoiceStatus = DRAFT
###  10. Record payment (full)         → PaymentStatus = COMPLETED
###                                    → InvoiceStatus = PAID
###
### Replace @leadId / @customerId / @opportunityId / @quotationId /
### @salesOrderId / @invoiceId with IDs from prior responses.
### Prefer gateway :8080. Direct CRM :8082 also works with the same paths.
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@crmUrl = http://localhost:8082
@token = TOKEN
@leadId = 1
@customerId = 1
@opportunityId = 1
@quotationId = 1
@salesOrderId = 1
@invoiceId = 1

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 0) Auth — get JWT (Auth Service via Gateway)
### Expected: 200, data.accessToken + data.refreshToken
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Refresh access token
# @name refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.data.refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout (blacklist access jti + revoke refresh)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.data.refreshToken}}"
}

### Copy accessToken from login into @token above, or use:
### Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Current user profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Soft-delete customer (ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 1) Create lead
### Expected: 201, status = NEW
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createLead
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Lovelace",
  "email": "ada.lovelace.e2e@crm.local",
  "phone": "+251911000001",
  "company": "Analytical Engines PLC",
  "industry": "Technology",
  "jobTitle": "CTO",
  "budget": 150000,
  "source": "WEBSITE",
  "notes": "E2E happy-path lead"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 2) Qualify lead
### Expected: 200, status = QUALIFIED
### Allowed: NEW → CONTACTED | QUALIFIED | UNQUALIFIED | LOST
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name qualifyLead
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/{{leadId}}/status?status=QUALIFIED
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 3) Convert lead → customer + opportunity
### Expected: 200
###   lead.status = CONVERTED
###   convertedCustomerId set
###   convertedOpportunityId set (when createOpportunity=true)
###   opportunity.stage = NEW
### Requires: lead must be QUALIFIED (only QUALIFIED → CONVERTED)
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name convertLead
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/{{leadId}}/convert
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversionReason": "Budget confirmed, ready to buy",
  "createOpportunity": true,
  "opportunityTitle": "Analytical Engines — CRM suite",
  "opportunityValue": 150000
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 3b) Optional — advance opportunity stage
### Expected: 200, stage = PROPOSAL (example)
### Stages: NEW → NEEDS_ANALYSIS → QUALIFICATION → PROPOSAL → NEGOTIATION → CLOSED_WON|CLOSED_LOST
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities/{{opportunityId}}/stage?stage=PROPOSAL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4) Create quotation (link customer + opportunity from convert)
### Expected: 201, status = DRAFT
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createQuotation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "opportunityId": {{opportunityId}},
  "issueDate": "2026-08-07",
  "expiryDate": "2026-09-07",
  "subtotal": 100000,
  "discount": 0,
  "tax": 15000,
  "totalAmount": 115000,
  "notes": "E2E quotation",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemName": "CRM License",
      "sku": "CRM-LIC-001",
      "description": "Annual seat license",
      "quantity": 10,
      "unitPrice": 10000
    }
  ]
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5) Send quotation (optional before accept)
### Expected: 200, status = SENT
### Allowed from DRAFT: SENT | CANCELLED | ACCEPTED
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name sendQuotation
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/quotations/{{quotationId}}/status?status=SENT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 6) Accept quotation → creates linked sales order
### Expected: 200
###   quotation.status = ACCEPTED (terminal)
###   sales order created with status = DRAFT, quotationId linked
###   response is SalesOrderResponseDTO (use id as @salesOrderId)
### Allowed accept from: DRAFT | SENT
### Blocked if quotation already linked to an order
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name acceptQuotation
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/quotations/{{quotationId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 7) Confirm sales order
### Expected: 200, status = APPROVED
### Publishes RabbitMQ sales.order.confirmed with SKU/qty for MMS
### Allowed: DRAFT → APPROVED (also PENDING → APPROVED)
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name confirmOrder
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/sales-orders/{{salesOrderId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 8) Create invoice from confirmed order
### Expected: 201
###   invoice.status = DRAFT
###   paidAmount = 0, balanceAmount = total
### Requires: order status APPROVED | PROCESSING | COMPLETED
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createInvoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "salesOrderId": {{salesOrderId}},
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "invoiceDate": "2026-08-07",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-21",
  "taxAmount": 15000,
  "discountAmount": 0,
  "currency": "ETB",
  "notes": "E2E invoice"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 9) Record full payment
### Expected: 201
###   payment.status = COMPLETED
###   invoice.paidAmount += amount
###   invoice.balanceAmount → 0 → invoice.status = PAID
### (Partial pay: if invoice was DRAFT/SENT and balance > 0 → PENDING)
### Blocked: amount ≤ 0, amount > balance, cancelled/fully-paid invoice
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createPayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": {{invoiceId}},
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "paymentMethod": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "amount": 115000,
  "paymentDate": "2026-08-07",
  "transactionReference": "E2E-TXN-001",
  "receivedBy": "admin",
  "notes": "Full settlement"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 10) Verify endpoints (optional)
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/{{leadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quotations/{{quotationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales-orders/{{salesOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/{{invoiceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================
### Other helpers
### ============================================================

### Register a sales officer (Auth via Gateway)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "officer1",
  "email": "officer1@crm.local",
  "password": "officer123",
  "role": "SALES_OFFICER"
}

### List customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Direct Auth Service (bypass gateway)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Direct CRM health
GET {{crmUrl}}/actuator/health
